<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK BUILDING EVACUATED AFTER BOMB SCARE.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK BUILDING EVACUATED AFTER BOMB SCARE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kredietbank building in Brussels' Arenbergstraat was briefly evacuated on Friday afternoon following a bomb scare, a Kredietbank spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said that an anonymous caller had warned that a bomb would go off, but a search of the premises proved that there was no bomb.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
